{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>尖沙咀文化中心中午懷疑發生電力故障起火，一名女子燒傷。<br/></p><p>20多歲的女傷者，面及頭敷上敷料，由救護員送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p><br/>警方約11時半接獲文化中心保安報案，指懷疑劇場因電力故障起火。消防一度出動一隊煙帽隊及一條喉在場戒備。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TST-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mNPm8bdQf41792385564.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:39:47.319110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:17:52.682049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:38:14.640943+00:00","content_hash":"0dd18f602d7c367d61c4115a2ef7e7aeb7a8806ddf0ff705b092c90a85b841b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}